            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>Welcome to Z Tool Offset Calibration Wizard!

This calibration helps you set the correct Z tool offset for accurate multi-tool printing.

Z Tool Offset is the difference in height between your tools when they are at the same Z position.

Wait for movements to finish, and then click Next to continue with the calibration process.</string>
